    "html": "<section class=\"page supplement supplement-5 notranslate\" translate=\"no\" data-page=\"61\" aria-labelledby=\"page-title\"><header class=\"supp-heading\"><div><span class=\"supp-kicker\">CHAPTER 02 · 補充 05</span><h1 id=\"page-title\">框架的嵌套</h1></div></header><div class=\"supp-content\"><div class=\"supp-columns nested-examples nested-with-python\" data-nested-stage=\"0\">\n<section class=\"supp-card nested-example\" aria-labelledby=\"nested-student-title\"><header class=\"nested-example-heading\"><h2 id=\"nested-student-title\">01　學生檔案</h2></header><div class=\"nested-tree\"><div class=\"nested-root\"><span class=\"nested-frame-name\">&lt;學生&gt;</span></div><ul class=\"nested-branches\"><li><div class=\"nested-row\"><b>姓名：</b><span>小明</span></div></li><li><div class=\"nested-row\"><b>班級：</b><span class=\"nested-frame-name\">&lt;班級框架&gt;</span></div><ul class=\"nested-branches\"><li><div class=\"nested-row\"><b>年級：</b><span>高一</span></div></li><li><div class=\"nested-row\"><b>班主任：</b><span class=\"nested-frame-name\">&lt;教師框架&gt;</span></div><ul class=\"nested-branches\"><li><div class=\"nested-row\"><b>姓名：</b><span>陳老師</span></div></li><li><div class=\"nested-row\"><b>任教科目：</b><span>人工智能</span></div></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></div><div class=\"nested-path\"><span>沿層級讀取</span><p>學生 → 班級 → 班主任 → 姓名<strong>取得「陳老師」</strong></p></div></section>\n<section class=\"supp-card nested-python\" id=\"nested-python-panel\" data-nested-reveal=\"1\" data-reveal-label=\"Python\" aria-hidden=\"true\" inert aria-labelledby=\"nested-python-title\"><header class=\"nested-example-heading\"><h2 id=\"nested-python-title\">Python 類別與物件</h2></header><button class=\"python-code-picture\" data-supp-picture=\"assets/generated/python-student-classes-v28.png\" aria-label=\"放大 Python 代碼截圖\"><img src=\"assets/generated/python-student-classes-v28.png\" alt=\"學生、班級、教師三個 Python 類別；逐層讀取學生1.班級.班主任.姓名，輸出陳老師。\" width=\"910\" height=\"889\"></button></section>\n<section class=\"supp-card nested-example\" id=\"nested-observation-panel\" data-nested-reveal=\"2\" data-reveal-label=\"植物觀察\" aria-hidden=\"true\" inert aria-labelledby=\"nested-observation-title\"><header class=\"nested-example-heading\"><h2 id=\"nested-observation-title\">02　植物觀察記錄</h2></header><div class=\"nested-tree\"><div class=\"nested-root\"><span class=\"nested-frame-name\">&lt;植物觀察記錄&gt;</span></div><ul class=\"nested-branches\"><li><div class=\"nested-row\"><b>植物：</b><span>綠豆</span></div></li><li><div class=\"nested-row\"><b>環境：</b><span class=\"nested-frame-name\">&lt;環境框架&gt;</span></div><ul class=\"nested-branches\"><li><div class=\"nested-row\"><b>溫度：</b><span>25°C</span></div></li><li><div class=\"nested-row\"><b>光照：</b><span class=\"nested-frame-name\">&lt;光照框架&gt;</span></div><ul class=\"nested-branches\"><li><div class=\"nested-row\"><b>光源：</b><span>LED燈</span></div></li><li><div class=\"nested-row\"><b>每日照射：</b><span>8小時</span></div></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></div><div class=\"nested-path\"><span>沿層級讀取</span><p>觀察記錄 → 環境 → 光照 → 每日照射<strong>取得「8小時」</strong></p></div></section>\n</div></div><div class=\"nested-controls\"><button data-nested-next data-play-label=\"播放下一步\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">▶</span> 播放下一步</button><button data-nested-reset hidden>重新播放</button><span class=\"nested-stage-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">0 / 2</span></div></section>",
